{"reviewId": "395956900_8cRVyzDVZ", "review": {"bookId": "3300128305", "content": "通涨上行 持有现金 不矛盾吗 怎么理解？", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "range": "1114-1193", "abstract": "(3)“经济下行，通胀上行”构成滞胀阶段。在滞胀阶段，现金收益率提高，持有现金最明智，经济下行对企业盈利的冲击将对股票构成负面影响，债券相对股票的收益率提高。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 14, "chapterName": "第二部分 大类资产配置", "chapterIdx": 14, "reviewId": "395956900_8cRVyzDVZ", "userVid": 395956900, "topics": [], "createTime": 1792043363, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "第二部分 大类资产配置", "author": {"userVid": 395956900, "name": "Erik_Wang", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0018-YcVHdaeSNK3P~O~IEieuVec/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "Erik_Wang", "isV": 0, "vDesc": "自由职业", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "精神避难所📖", "medalInfo": {"id": "M15-1-0", "desc": "21天阅读挑战", "title": "21天阅读挑战", "levelIndex": 0}}, "isDislike": 0}, "commentsCount": 1, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"content": "你可能会问：通胀这么高，现金不是也在贬值吗？\n是的。假设现金利息为4%、通胀为6%，实际购买力仍在下降。但如果同期股票跌20%、长期债券跌10%，现金的损失相对较小。", "reviewId": "395956900_8cRVyzDVZ", "commentId": "395956900_8cRVyzDVZ_c395956900_8cRZCiO8k", "userVid": 395956900, "createTime": 1792047082, "author": {"userVid": 395956900, "name": "Erik_Wang", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0018-YcVHdaeSNK3P~O~IEieuVec/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "Erik_Wang", "isV": 0, "vDesc": "自由职业", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "精神避难所📖", "medalInfo": {"id": "M15-1-0", "desc": "21天阅读挑战", "title": "21天阅读挑战"